{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42063","headline":"送圆上人归庐山 · 李中","name":"送圆上人归庐山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莲宫旧隐尘埃外，策杖临风拂袖还。\n踏雪独寻青嶂下，听猨重入白云间。\n萧骚红树当门老，斑駮苍苔鏁径闲。\n预想松轩夜禅处，虎溪圆月照空山。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42063.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42063","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}